//RS /// Negotiate and render one service failure. The caller supplies the
//RS /// normalized `JetErrorReport`; both media types are rendered from the same
//RS /// bounded projection, and request metadata is copied into either response.
// END-PORT-PENDING 0278 crates/jet-codegen/src/Prelude/CoreLib/Top/HTTPServer.rs:1-1807

